<title>UK: Ayala Corp unit sets $100 mln convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Ayala Corp unit sets $100 mln convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AC INTERNATIONAL FINANCE LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  AYALA CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     0.5 PCT   MATURITY    30.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE     CONVERTIBLE ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S 30.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	PREMIUM    17 PCT    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES	=</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 LISTING    ONE	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.333</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PRICE  34.75 PESOS</p>
<p>		REDEMPTION AT 141.423 PCT TO GIVE A SPREAD OF 50 BP</p>
<p>		OVER THE FIVE-YEAR UST.</p>
<p>		NO CALL FOR THREE-YEARS, THEREAFTER CALLABLE AT</p>
<p>		ACCRETED VALUE SUBJECT TO 140 PCT HURDLE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
